                  34.5 kg) ' (  Mechanical Design Load \(Front\):       5400 Pa \(Snow load\)) ' (  Mechanical Design Load \(Rear\):        2400 Pa \(Wind load\)) ' () ' (5. WARRANTY & LIFETIME PERFORMANCE) ' (  Product Workmanship Warranty:         12.0 Years) ' (  Linear Power Output Warranty:         25.0 Years) ' (  Annual Linear Degradation:            0.50 % / year) ' (  End of Warranty Retained Output:      85.0 %) ' () ' (6. PROVENANCE & ARCHIVAL METADATA) ' (  Authoritative URL: https://www.firstsolar.com/-/media/First-Solar/Technical-Documents/Series-6-Plus-Datasheet.pdf) ' (  Document Verification: OFFICIAL_FAMILY_DOCUMENT) ' (  Installation Mapping: BENCHMARK_REFERENCE_MODULE) ' (  Verification Date: 2026-11-10) ' (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) ' (SolarSelect MLOps Hardware Database Reference Standard IEC 61215 / IEC 61730) ' ET
